WEBVTT

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:16.620
<i>Along a zigzag the world turns,</i>
<i>I heave out a sigh.</i>

00:00:16.730 --> 00:00:27.640
<i>Someone pauses along the way,</i>
<i>but reality moves on.</i>

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:33.170
<i>Treat love as love, treat</i>
<i>dreams as dreams.</i>

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:38.680
<i>It's difficult to say it in earnest.</i>
<i>The times forge ahead, but...</i>

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:43.660
<i>I want to make you happy...</i>

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:49.390
<i>I'll do so like I do to</i>
<i>be myself. Yeah!</i>

00:00:49.490 --> 00:00:54.420
<i>I'll make you happy...</i>

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:59.830
<i>I dedicate all that</i>
<i>I can do to you.</i>

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:11.150
<i>Along a zigzag the world turns,</i>
<i>I heave out a sigh.</i>

00:01:11.220 --> 00:01:23.390
<i>Someone pauses along the way,</i>
<i>but love doesn't stop for me.</i>

00:01:36.710 --> 00:01:38.680
What are you
saying?!

00:01:41.650 --> 00:01:43.380
Don't tell me
what to do!

00:01:43.480 --> 00:01:46.140
I don't have to listen to
this. I'm hanging up!

00:01:50.220 --> 00:01:51.950
Good-bye! And
I mean forever!

00:01:57.230 --> 00:02:03.930
Ah, what a mistake that was. I never
should've told them my number.

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:06.130
Oh no! I can't
believe this!

00:02:13.410 --> 00:02:17.280
Why do stupid things like this
happen to me all the time?

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:50.450
Are you
awake?

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:00.090
You're a
priest.

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:03.890
Let's go into the temple's main hall,
and speak in Buddha's presence.

00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:13.090
FILE. 12
I WANT TO BE A
POL1CEWOMAN!

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:17.530
What?! I think there's been
a misunderstanding.

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:20.010
Oh! Of course!
My apologies.

00:03:20.110 --> 00:03:22.580
I figured since you jumped
out onto the road...

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:26.140
Well, I would've chosen a prettier
way to go, anyway.

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:29.480
Like in a really secluded lake,
or a snowy mountain.

00:03:29.590 --> 00:03:31.850
Or how about
a glacier!

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:35.260
You shouldn't even joke
about such things.

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:37.760
I'm just
bored.

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:40.830
I know! What do you think about
me becoming a priestess?

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:48.400
Their robes are quite sexy, I think.
Can you make me a priestess?

00:03:48.510 --> 00:03:52.370
High school girls only get to enjoy
one brief moment of glory.

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:55.380
I'm afraid I can't take in disciples unless
they're completely serious about it.

00:03:55.550 --> 00:04:00.610
That's terrible! What makes you think you
can tell whether I'm serious or not?

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:03.350
Maybe it's something I've been
thinking about for a long time!

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:06.750
Oh, I'm sorry. It's
just that...

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:09.720
Then that means I can come here every-
day and take an afternoon nap!

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:14.990
Oh yeah! Will you tell me
your phone number?

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:18.070
Just in case I need
to call you.

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:29.810
Yahoo!
Huh?

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:31.950
...46. There. It's
in the memory.

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:34.250
"The Monk - The number saved"

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:36.750
"The Monk?"

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:38.680
Hello there!

00:04:38.860 --> 00:04:40.650
We didn't know you
had company.

00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:43.690
Oh! It's been
a long time.

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:46.530
Well, this is good timing.
This young lady here...

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:50.260
Hi, I'm Saori Saga. I'm the
priest's girlfriend.

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:51.630
Right, Daddy?

00:04:51.800 --> 00:04:53.330
"D... Daddy?"

00:05:05.050 --> 00:05:07.540
You were just kidding about becoming
a priestess, right?

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:08.510
Maybe...

00:05:08.690 --> 00:05:10.420
What do you mean
by that?

00:05:10.590 --> 00:05:12.950
Nothing. I don't really care
one way or the other.

00:05:13.060 --> 00:05:15.580
It just seems kind
of neat, that's all.

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:21.060
Slow down!

00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:26.540
Anyway, life is stupid and things
aren't going to get any better.

00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:28.160
'Cause this world is
totally screwed up.

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:30.640
Lots of things in life
aren't screwed up.

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:32.300
So you mean you're
happy?

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:35.000
Whatever!

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:37.310
You've got a pretty rude way
of talking to people, kid!

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:39.980
And you totally made up that story
about yourself and the priest!

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:43.780
But I am particular
about people.

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:53.830
Be careful.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:56.030
What, you think I'm gonna jump
onto the tracks or something?

00:05:56.030 --> 00:05:57.020
Hey!

00:05:57.200 --> 00:06:00.260
Kidding! Thanks
for the lift. Bye.

00:06:04.780 --> 00:06:07.610
Kids these days. Things
sure have changed.

00:06:09.150 --> 00:06:11.080
What was her name?
Saori, was it?

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:14.080
Well, I'm sure she's not as negative
as she makes herself out to be.

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:15.220
You think?

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:17.290
She did thank
us, after all.

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:20.520
And isn't she at that age when kids
try to act cynical about everything?

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:23.060
And think life is
meaningless?

00:06:24.600 --> 00:06:25.720
Perhaps.

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:29.860
Maybe it's all right, as long
as they're just thoughts.

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:33.560
Be a companion?

00:06:34.140 --> 00:06:36.440
If you would, it'd
make me happy.

00:06:36.610 --> 00:06:37.970
Depends on
the person.

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:39.910
You mean if it's
us, you will?

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:41.910
You've got to be kidding!
You reek of booze.

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:44.340
Well, I don't
smell at all!

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:46.420
Let go
of me!

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:49.280
Aah!

00:06:49.390 --> 00:06:50.980
You ugly
wench!

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:14.010
Oh, no!

00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:17.210
Hold it right
there!

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:31.130
On your feet!
Move it!

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:37.920
We should've stayed with you until
you got on. Not hurt, are you?

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:44.630
It's probably
good.

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:45.640
Huh?

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:47.470
You're way more cool
than a priestess!

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:49.240
What is? What
are you?

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:53.080
Please teach me everything
you know, Miss Miyuki!

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:55.010
"Miss?"

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:01.820
Natsumi! My mentor!
Good morning!

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:08.430
I came to give
this to you!

00:08:08.530 --> 00:08:11.520
I thought maybe you two could eat it on
your rounds. There's sandwiches...

00:08:11.640 --> 00:08:14.370
...some hot clam chowder,
and apple pie for dessert!

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:21.070
Quit pulling my arm. You're
gonna break it.

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:23.580
Pipe down! You were doing
30 km over the limit.

00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:26.720
Yeah, right. You have any
idea who my Mom is?

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:31.290
Hush up. Sounds like you
have a Mother complex!

00:08:32.790 --> 00:08:35.050
What?! A "Mother
complex?"

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:39.730
He won't bother
you anymore.

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:42.230
"Sale! 5;00-6;00 p.m. only!"

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:46.560
Tell me where this
supermarket is!

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:48.970
Welcome!

00:08:48.970 --> 00:08:49.670
Er...

00:08:50.910 --> 00:08:53.640
Is there something I can
help you with today?

00:08:53.740 --> 00:08:57.410
Oh, I know this store. Take the north
exit at the station and go straight.

00:08:57.520 --> 00:09:00.810
Turn at the second convenience store, and
just go straight. It's right by the cafe.

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:03.440
Will there be anything else
for you today, ma'am?

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:04.090
...oh, Honey...

00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:05.050
Will that
be all?

00:09:05.220 --> 00:09:06.620
To the station, Hon!

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:09.350
Thank you very much
for coming!

00:09:09.530 --> 00:09:11.430
Hey, not bad!

00:09:11.600 --> 00:09:14.690
However, we can't just forget about
her after all that's happened.

00:09:15.430 --> 00:09:18.660
Maybe you just have to sit
her down and talk to her.

00:09:22.340 --> 00:09:25.170
It's very flattering
and all, but...

00:09:26.280 --> 00:09:29.800
Is something wrong with me just wanting to
see what it's like being in your shoes?

00:09:30.610 --> 00:09:31.420
Of course there is.

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:34.040
But thanks for the lunch.
It was really delicious.

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:35.290
Then I'll make you
lunch again!

00:09:35.290 --> 00:09:37.250
No. Please don't.

00:09:38.520 --> 00:09:40.850
So you're saying I've
been a nuisance.

00:09:41.030 --> 00:09:44.190
It's just that people who have no business
in the station shouldn't come inside.

00:09:44.960 --> 00:09:48.630
"Have no business?"
I see.

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:55.140
Maybe I should move out of my
home, or maybe I should...

00:09:55.310 --> 00:09:56.210
W... Wait!

00:09:56.210 --> 00:09:58.700
W... Wait!
Enough with the melodrama already.

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:01.540
How can you! Here I've
been thinking that...

00:10:01.650 --> 00:10:03.980
...the only thing I really truly want to
do is to become a policewoman.

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:05.450
That's an awful thing to say!
You're my mentor!

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:07.480
Please! Anything
but "mentor!"

00:10:08.090 --> 00:10:09.710
Hasn't anybody told
her to stop that?

00:10:09.890 --> 00:10:11.150
Well, by the time
I noticed...

00:10:11.320 --> 00:10:13.050
It was so
sudden.

00:10:13.220 --> 00:10:14.050
Natsumi!

00:10:14.230 --> 00:10:17.160
It's good to have dreams, but you've got to
take a good close look at reality, too.

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:21.560
The police force isn't
all rosy, you know?

00:10:21.670 --> 00:10:23.860
Feast your eyes
on this!

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:27.060
Natsumi! Stop
that!

00:10:27.240 --> 00:10:29.330
Freaks like this are
in the force, too!

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:31.670
Well, did that open
your eyes a little?

00:10:31.840 --> 00:10:33.170
I don't believe
this!

00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:35.740
Perfect!

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:39.880
Your disguise is perfect!
It's the only way!

00:10:43.290 --> 00:10:45.950
Enough with those fantasies
of yours! This is reality!

00:10:48.360 --> 00:10:50.490
Right here!

00:10:51.160 --> 00:10:53.130
Uh... uh... Aah!

00:11:07.510 --> 00:11:09.810
Wha?!

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:12.850
See what I mean?! Now just
stop glorifying this job!

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:14.950
Wait, it's not what it looks like!

00:11:14.950 --> 00:11:17.850
You're a pervert, you mix up your
private life with your work...

00:11:17.960 --> 00:11:19.950
...you're clumsy, you can't speak in front
of people! You call yourself normal?!

00:11:20.120 --> 00:11:22.090
Wait! You've misunderstood!

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:29.360
"Zubizuba:" Ultra-Super-Duper

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:31.590
That's not what it looks
like! It's uh... uh...

00:11:31.770 --> 00:11:35.400
No need for explanations! Still think
you'd like to work on the force?

00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:38.630
That's a rare find. Zubizuba
Productions' first release.

00:11:38.810 --> 00:11:39.780
Detective Tokuno!

00:11:39.940 --> 00:11:44.010
They used to make some great videos, but
I heard they've had some cash problems...

00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:47.450
...they got an amateur in to help out,
but he's really let things slip.

00:11:47.620 --> 00:11:50.590
Detective Tokuno! How
do you know all that?!

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:51.910
I'm in the middle of
an investigation.

00:11:52.090 --> 00:11:53.990
Oh, I see!

00:11:54.160 --> 00:11:57.820
That's incredible! Collecting this many
videos for your investigations!

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:02.860
In this business, research is just another
part of the job! Right, officers?

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:04.240
Yes, sir!

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:06.040
Yes, sir!
Yeah, this is just part of my job!

00:12:06.040 --> 00:12:07.500
Yeah, this is just part of my job!

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:07.610
No, this is part of your hobby!

00:12:07.610 --> 00:12:08.070
No!

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:10.300
What are all those videos
for anyway?

00:12:10.470 --> 00:12:11.810
I can tell you!

00:12:11.980 --> 00:12:13.570
But aren't they NC-17
or restricted?

00:12:13.740 --> 00:12:17.700
But they're part of an investigation, so they
have to be looked at professionally.

00:12:18.650 --> 00:12:19.350
You lie!

00:12:19.350 --> 00:12:21.680
Do not! Let me explain!

00:12:21.850 --> 00:12:23.150
That hurt, man! What gives?

00:12:23.150 --> 00:12:24.520
You hurt ME! Are you bustin' me or what?!

00:12:24.520 --> 00:12:24.890
That's not it!

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:26.450
This is enough!

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:28.550
I will not speak to Nakajima
for the time being!

00:12:28.730 --> 00:12:31.290
Say what?!

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:33.790
"Resources"

00:12:34.330 --> 00:12:38.670
Saori's just curious about our work, Natsumi.
I doubt it's a serious dream of hers.

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:42.070
That's why I think you're taking an
entirely wrong approach to this.

00:12:45.140 --> 00:12:47.340
Wowie! You're
light! 42 kg.

00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:49.480
And next is your
height.

00:12:50.010 --> 00:12:52.070
152 centimeters.

00:12:52.280 --> 00:12:53.220
"Challenge the Future"
"Officers Wanted!"

00:12:53.220 --> 00:12:57.520
In order to join the police force, first
you have to pass an examination.

00:12:57.690 --> 00:13:00.380
But before that, to be eligible
for recruitment...

00:13:00.490 --> 00:13:03.620
...you have to be at least 154 cm
tall, and weigh at least 45 kg.

00:13:03.790 --> 00:13:05.660
What? That
means...

00:13:05.830 --> 00:13:07.560
"Joursie Milk"

00:13:08.270 --> 00:13:11.630
This is in return for the lunch,
and all your help. Good luck!

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:23.980
"Good luck," she
says! Ha!

00:13:24.350 --> 00:13:26.870
"The Year-End Sale"
Am I supposed to wait another
two or three years?!

00:13:26.980 --> 00:13:30.150
Well if I can't join right now then
I don't want to join at all!

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:41.020
Anyway, who even cares?
I sure don't!

00:13:41.930 --> 00:13:44.030
He was disgusting!

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:49.430
Who's got ¥100,000 to throw
around, anyway?!

00:13:52.210 --> 00:13:55.240
Yo, babe! That's one gorgeous pair of legs
you got there! And I mean gorgeous!

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:59.440
I bet if I wait another ten years, I won't
ever see legs as beautiful as yours.

00:13:59.550 --> 00:14:02.380
So, won't you consider?

00:14:02.550 --> 00:14:04.750
There's a reason why
we have trash cans!

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:08.620
Silly girls.

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:10.590
Got a minute,
sweetheart?

00:14:12.300 --> 00:14:15.390
Mm-mm! Look at those beautiful
eyes of yours!

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:18.160
This is real fate, meeting
you by chance like this!

00:14:18.340 --> 00:14:19.960
Are you the ¥100,000
guy?

00:14:20.140 --> 00:14:20.800
Huh?

00:14:20.970 --> 00:14:24.500
I've got things to do, so let's
not waste each other's time.

00:14:24.680 --> 00:14:26.400
W... Wait!

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:28.480
Wait! I'll give you
¥200,000!

00:14:28.650 --> 00:14:30.740
Forget it! I know
you're a fraud.

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:33.640
You're wrong! I'm
a video producer!

00:14:33.750 --> 00:14:37.210
Really! Look, I have a business
card and everything!

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:40.380
Zubizuba Productions.

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:44.580
I'm the director, name's Tsuyama. Well?
I'll make you look real good on-screen!

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:48.430
Sure, let's talk.

00:14:56.640 --> 00:14:58.540
"Super Porn"

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:09.480
Now I'm in
trouble.

00:15:09.650 --> 00:15:12.380
I'm telling you, get
here right away!

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:16.450
C'mon, this will be a quick shoot!
Don't forget the gear!

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:22.190
Sorry to keep you
waiting! Huh?

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:24.700
I'm leaving.

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:26.460
L... Leaving?!
How come?

00:15:26.640 --> 00:15:27.970
Cause I figured out
what this is about.

00:15:28.140 --> 00:15:31.510
Wait a minute! The camera-
man's on the way!

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:33.910
You've never done a camera
test before, right?!

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:34.980
I'm not interested.

00:15:35.150 --> 00:15:38.410
I'm begging you! Think of
all that money! ¥200,000!

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:39.570
No, thank you.

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:44.050
How could you? I even went
out and got you this drink!

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:47.320
Milk.

00:15:47.490 --> 00:15:48.360
What?

00:15:48.530 --> 00:15:51.150
I don't want coffee.
I want Joursie Milk.

00:15:51.260 --> 00:15:54.230
Pasteurized Joursie Milk. I've
got to have that kind.

00:15:56.030 --> 00:15:58.800
Joursie Milk, huh?
I'll be back.

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:01.800
Hope I can
find it.

00:16:06.180 --> 00:16:07.580
Ta-da!

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:19.880
Hello, Jirikihongan
Temple. Yes?

00:16:23.730 --> 00:16:26.220
Uh-oh!

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:29.220
Oh? She's a lot better
than I was told!

00:16:32.370 --> 00:16:34.130
A prank
call?

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:37.210
Hello? I'm Yoshida,
your cameraman.

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:40.900
Geez, I ran all over
to find this milk!

00:16:41.410 --> 00:16:43.900
Now I'm in even
worse trouble!

00:16:47.280 --> 00:16:50.250
Hello? Will you
stop this!

00:16:51.050 --> 00:16:52.280
Huh?

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:55.250
Do it the same as always. Just
take a bunch of shots.

00:16:55.430 --> 00:16:56.410
Sure!

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:59.220
What do you plan to do
with that camera?

00:16:59.400 --> 00:17:01.560
We're just going to do a camera
test with you.

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:05.690
But really what your Zubizuba Production
Company is all about is porno, right?

00:17:06.470 --> 00:17:07.490
It's that student.

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:10.470
You want to do it right here? You
said it was near the station...

00:17:10.570 --> 00:17:12.130
...but this is just a lousy
one-room apartment!

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:13.900
But I guess that
doesn't matter.

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:21.180
I don't believe
her!

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:23.650
So you're sure she's
trapped there?

00:17:23.820 --> 00:17:26.620
It seems to be a little more
than just an act.

00:17:27.820 --> 00:17:31.950
An apartment by the station?! There're
gazillions of apartments in the area!

00:17:32.130 --> 00:17:32.650
Wait!

00:17:34.000 --> 00:17:36.430
Sounds like there's a neon tobacco
sign right outside her apartment.

00:17:37.770 --> 00:17:42.000
What a dreary view you have from this
window! Especially that neon sign.

00:17:42.470 --> 00:17:44.840
It totally covers
up Mt. Fuji!

00:17:45.010 --> 00:17:49.000
You're pretty straightforward!
I like that, though!

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:52.080
When I do something, I really
put my heart into it.

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:56.210
It's a one-room apartment, with a window
facing west. The big neon sign is nearby.

00:17:56.620 --> 00:18:00.320
There're 5 buildings fitting that description.
And who knows how many rooms.

00:18:01.190 --> 00:18:04.790
Shut the curtains. But
keep the window open.

00:18:04.900 --> 00:18:07.330
It reeks of nicotine
in here!

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:10.760
The window is open, but
the curtains are closed.

00:18:11.370 --> 00:18:13.840
Are those the best curtains
you've got?

00:18:21.350 --> 00:18:23.310
Uh-oh.

00:18:25.720 --> 00:18:27.120
My Kokutani
ceramic!

00:18:27.280 --> 00:18:29.150
What happened?

00:18:32.520 --> 00:18:35.320
You can call your friends as
much as you want... Later.

00:18:35.430 --> 00:18:37.260
Sorry I had to hang
up like that.

00:18:37.430 --> 00:18:38.860
Camera's all
ready.

00:18:39.030 --> 00:18:41.330
All right. Let's get this
show on the road.

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:46.300
Don't worry, we'll cover
up what we have to.

00:18:46.400 --> 00:18:49.130
Let's just stop this
fighting, all right?

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:51.970
What do you want me to do?
Want me to start rolling?

00:18:55.610 --> 00:18:59.380
You want to start by yourself? Or you
want someone to help you get going?

00:18:59.550 --> 00:19:01.450
Neither way!

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:04.590
Don't think of backing
out of it now.

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:13.600
Come on.

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:19.060
All right.

00:19:19.740 --> 00:19:21.830
There!

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:24.410
Get down!

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:37.380
I'm scared!

00:19:37.550 --> 00:19:38.080
Let's get
her!

00:19:38.260 --> 00:19:39.520
Yeah!

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:45.990
Saori!

00:19:53.300 --> 00:19:55.930
Oh my goodness!

00:19:56.110 --> 00:19:57.940
I won't stand
for it!

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:26.860
Mr. Oshou!

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:27.700
Hmm?

00:20:34.950 --> 00:20:38.040
Look at this! It's a commendation
from the police.

00:20:38.450 --> 00:20:41.940
Thank you for your help,
also, Mr. Oshou.

00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:44.750
Detective Tokuno also
sends his regards.

00:20:44.920 --> 00:20:47.010
There's no need
to thank me.

00:20:47.190 --> 00:20:50.130
I thought I was really going
to be in trouble back there.

00:20:50.230 --> 00:20:52.660
If the two of you hadn't
come and saved me...

00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:53.760
You see?

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:56.630
Well, I hope you've learned some-
thing from this. Hmm?

00:20:56.800 --> 00:20:58.960
Me? Learn? I don't
think so!

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:06.510
I really felt how important
being alive is to me...

00:21:06.680 --> 00:21:10.540
...when I was up there on that
balcony, about to jump off.

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:15.440
And it was the two of you -
Natsumi and Miyuki...

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:17.750
...who came to save
my life.

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:26.690
And it was then I really
felt deep in my heart...

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:29.770
...that I wanted to become
a policewoman.

00:21:34.500 --> 00:21:38.530
Natsumi? Miyuki? I'm going to start
calling you my mentors again!

00:21:38.640 --> 00:21:41.770
And I hope you'll call
me your disciple!

00:21:41.950 --> 00:21:43.610
W... Wait a
sec!

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:48.680
I, Saori Saga, will become a police-
woman no matter what it takes!

00:22:02.600 --> 00:22:07.600
<i>I live my life my own way, doing</i>
<i>things others wouldn't.</i>

00:22:11.940 --> 00:22:19.780
<i>Being strong isn't enough.</i>
<i>It makes me Ionely.</i>

00:22:22.490 --> 00:22:30.790
<i>I can feel your presence</i>
<i>as if you're right here...</i>

00:22:31.330 --> 00:22:38.900
<i>... but I can't say a word.</i>

00:22:40.440 --> 00:22:47.630
<i>The feelings I hide within might</i>
<i>break into pieces...</i>

00:22:49.180 --> 00:22:56.550
<i>But if I don't say anything,</i>
<i>nothing can begin.</i>

00:22:56.890 --> 00:23:04.120
<i>The wind gently blows...</i>
<i>Time flows...</i>

00:23:04.290 --> 00:23:13.840
<i>Time flows... And soon</i>
<i>I can be honest...</i>

00:23:13.970 --> 00:23:16.900
<i>Thank you,</i>
<i>friend!</i>

00:23:23.110 --> 00:23:25.050
"Hot Springs"

00:23:26.180 --> 00:23:28.380
Hey everyone! We're
on vacation!

00:23:28.550 --> 00:23:31.520
Yeah! Party!
Party!

00:23:31.690 --> 00:23:32.120
Hot springs!

00:23:32.120 --> 00:23:32.590
Good food!

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:33.020
Parties!

00:23:33.190 --> 00:23:35.190
We'll be too busy to sleep!

00:23:35.190 --> 00:23:35.950
I'll be too drunk not to!

00:23:36.130 --> 00:23:36.650
Damn right!

00:23:36.830 --> 00:23:38.790
Oh, c'mon guys! Natsumi
just likes to party!

00:23:38.960 --> 00:23:41.400
And who was it that stayed
out all night last time?!

00:23:41.570 --> 00:23:44.030
Uh, well...

00:23:44.200 --> 00:23:47.440
Next time on You're Under Arrest, File 13,
"Big Trouble At The Little Onsen."

00:23:47.570 --> 00:23:50.570
If only the Chief could
see me now!
